{"t":"POWL","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"Powell Industries, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","employees":3311,"hq":"Houston, TX, United States","website":"https://www.powellind.com","summary_en":"Powell Industries, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, designs, develops, manufactures, sells, and services custom-engineered equipment and systems. The company's products portfolio includes integrated power control room substations, custom-engineered modules, and electrical houses; and traditional and arc-resistant distribution switchgears and control gears, medium-voltage circuit breakers, monitoring and control communications systems, motor control centers, switches, and bus duct systems. It also provides field service inspection, installation, commissioning, modification, and repair services; spare parts; retrofit and retrofill components for existing systems; and replacement circuit breakers for switchgears. The company serves onshore and offshore production, liquefied natural gas facilities and terminals, pipelines and refineries, petrochemical, electric utility, light rail traction power, mining and metals, pulp and paper, data centers, commercial construction, and other industrial markets, as well as universities and government entities. It operates in the United States, Canada, the Middle East, Africa, Europe, Mexico, the Asia/Pacific, and Central and South America. Powell Industries, Inc. was founded in 1947 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Powell Industries, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 맞춤형 엔지니어링 장비 및 시스템을 설계, 개발, 제조, 판매 및 서비스합니다. 회사의 제품 포트폴리오에는 통합 전력 제어실 변전소, 맞춤형 엔지니어링 모듈 및 전기 주택이 포함됩니다. 기존의 아크 방지 배전 개폐 장치 및 제어 장치, 중압 회로 차단기, 모니터링 및 제어 통신 시스템, 모터 제어 센터, 스위치 및 버스 덕트 시스템. 또한 현장 서비스 검사, 설치, 시운전, 수정 및 수리 서비스도 제공합니다. 예비 부품; 기존 시스템의 구성 요소를 개조하고 개조합니다. 개폐 장치용 교체 회로 차단기. 이 회사는 육상 및 해상 생산, 액화 천연 가스 시설 및 터미널, 파이프라인 및 정유소, 석유화학, 전기 유틸리티, 경전철 견인력, 광업 및 금속, 펄프 및 제지, 데이터 센터, 상업용 건설, 기타 산업 시장은 물론 대학 및 정부 기관에 서비스를 제공합니다. 미국, 캐나다, 중동, 아프리카, 유럽, 멕시코, 아시아/태평양, 중남미에서 운영됩니다. Powell Industries, Inc.는 1947년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 휴스턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":161.98,"mcap":5905543168.0,"pe":24.542423,"fpe":16.692223,"peg":1.4905,"ps":4.700945,"pb":7.0511928,"ev_ebitda":18.442,"div":0.24,"beta":1.234,"hi52":328.0,"lo52":95.0},"fin":{"rev":1256246016.0,"rev_g":0.331,"eps_g":0.582,"gross":0.31282,"op":0.21094,"net":0.17591,"roe":0.2991,"fcf":344341504.0,"cash":860825024.0,"debt":2566000.0,"de":0.307,"eps":6.6,"feps":9.70392},"own":{"short":0.1185,"inst":0.93204004,"insider":0.20443001},"analyst":{"n":4,"mean":228.75,"median":231.0,"high":275.0,"low":178.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.25,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-13","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":250.0,"priorPriceTarget":300.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-01","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":235.0,"priorPriceTarget":235.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-14","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":235.0,"priorPriceTarget":320.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-05-11","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":320.0,"priorPriceTarget":160.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-05-06","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":360.0,"priorPriceTarget":310.0},{"